  "summary": {
    "plain": "Using ten detectors and thresholds as low as 1.7 keV, PICASSO set tighter limits on spin-dependent interactions of light WIMPs and, for the first time, also on spin-independent ones.",
    "technical": "Subset of 10 detectors with 0.72 kg of 19F and 114 kg d exposure: sigma_p(SD) = 0.032 pb at 20 GeV/c^2; sigma_p(SI) = 1.41e-4 pb excluded near 7 GeV/c^2 (90% C.L.)."
  },
  "title": "Constraints on Low-Mass WIMP Interactions on 19F from PICASSO",
